# Spice St. Market — Cursor Rules

project_goals:
  - Lean static rebuild of the Webflow brand site for Cloudflare Workers.
  - Preserve brand voice, pack storytelling, and spice imagery.
  - Prefer seamless scroll motion and page transitions that feel street / bodega / spice-forward.

editing_guidelines:
  - Preserve indentation and formatting.
  - Avoid unrelated refactors; keep edits tightly scoped.
  - Do not rename asset paths in source/cdn or dist/images without updating build jobs.
  - Prefer small, self-contained edits with descriptive commit messages.

technology_direction:
  - Vanilla HTML + CSS + JS modules bundled with esbuild.
  - GSAP + ScrollTrigger + Lenis for motion; respect prefers-reduced-motion.
  - Content lives in src/data/*.json (no Airtable sync in this repo).
  - Build pipeline: scrape → optimize images → minify → dist/ → wrangler deploy.

repository_conventions:
  - Automation in scripts/
  - Hand-built site in src/
  - Untouched scrape baseline in source/
  - Commit messages: chore|feat|fix|docs: short description

brand:
  - Colors: spice-red #510604, orange #da522a, honey-mustard #ffda88, dijon #f8e7c2, wheat #fff8e7, navy #13172a, light-green #85eba8
  - Tagline: If you ain't sneezin, you ain't seasonin
  - CTAs drive to Amazon spice packs

accessibility:
  - Keyboard-navigable pack tabs and lightbox
  - Sufficient contrast; no motion-only information
